  m_text: 'This game contains intense flashing lights, sudden loud sounds, and unexpected
    jump scares that may startle or disturb some players. The experience is designed
    to create tension and fear, with unpredictable events that can occur at any moment
    without warning.


    Players who are sensitive to flashing lights, have a history
    of epilepsy, heart conditions, or are easily frightened are strongly advised
    to proceed with caution or avoid playing this game altogether.


    By continuing,
    you acknowledge that you understand the nature of this experience and choose
    to play at your own risk. The creators of this game are not responsible for any
    discomfort, fear, or adverse reactions that may occur during gameplay.'
